# plain-debris: the saved game the plain-debris enhanced session starts from. A new character,
# as the newgame session makes one (every default, the name avatar); then a test's cheat
# (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a scroll of Light (0x138, spell 0, as a level
# stores an enchanted scroll) of quality 1, into the pack, so that one hard throw breaks it.
# Saved in slot I, described "debris"
9000 key esc
12000 key esc
15000 key enter        # Create Character
18000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
20000 key enter        # the difficulty
22000 key enter
24000 key enter
26000 key enter
28000 key enter
30000 key enter
32000 key enter
34000 key a            # the name
34200 key v
34400 key a
34600 key t
34800 key a
35000 key r
36000 key enter
38000 key enter        # Yes
44000 cheat give 0x138 1 1 spell 0
47000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot I, "debris"
47100 key s
47300 up ctrl
49000 key enter
50500 key d
50700 key e
50900 key b
51100 key r
51300 key i
51500 key s
52000 key enter
